ce a physical binding relation without duplicating materials. Report actual geometry and limited test results, including slip or damage. Permit inspection and an untying attempt; do not grant a strength rating or claim shelter effects.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"rest\\\",\\\"args\\\":{}},\\\"repeat\\\":4,\\\"until\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":40},\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The berry meal is an actual small trial, not an assumption of safety or a guaranteed wellbeing benefit.\\\",\\\"A requested method is not personal mastery; study its returned contract before attempting work.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cord-joining-study\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can two short reed cords be joined reversibly, and what limited load can the actual joint hold?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"At tick 263 the attempt produced a tied sheet bend between item-226-wren-2532 and item-250-wren-2847.\\\",\\\"At tick 264 the join held 5 N for 30 seconds with zero recorded tail displacement, retained deformation or broken strands; each cord extended elastically by 0.0007 m.\\\",\\\"Untying completed at tick 267 and returned both original items.\\\",\\\"Direct inspections at ticks 269 and 270 recorded separate straight cords with 0.34 m centrelines, zero join crossings and no partner or join id. Their recorded conditions were 0.9745 and 0.9865.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"One bounded trial does not establish safe working load, repeated-load durability, or reversibility after heavier loading.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Document one conservative load trial and recovery of separate cords, with measured limitations.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned joining personally.\\\",\\\"Made a second cord and completed a sheet bend.\\\",\\\"Tested at 5 N