\"hand-lash-branches\\\",\\\"function\\\":\\\"Learn to bind two owned branches at a crossing using an owned handmade fiber cord, then inspect, conservatively hand-test, and undo the actual binding.\\\",\\\"conditions\\\":\\\"Bare hands on dry footing; actual nearby space, branch geometry, cord length, condition, friction and available grips must determine feasibility. I own two separate reed cords, each with a 0.34 m centreline, but have not collected branches for this trial.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"Exact owned branch and cord item identities; a chosen crossing arrangement; bounded test force and duration if testing. No invented tools, anchors, extra cord or branches.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, study time, work stages and material requirements are unknown. Charge actual study and work time; preserve paid progress and identify any reserved material and cancellation effects.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"If feasible, produce a physical binding relation without duplicating materials. Report actual geometry and limited test results, including slip or damage. Permit inspection and an untying attempt; do not grant a strength rating or claim shelter effects.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"rest\\\",\\\"args\\\":{}},\\\"repeat\\\":4,\\\"until\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":40},\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The berry meal is an actual small trial, not an assumption of safety or a guaranteed wellbeing benefit.\\\",\\\"A requested method is not personal mastery; study its returned contract before attempting work.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cord-joining-study\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can two short reed cords be joined reversibly, and what limited load can the actual joint hold?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"At tick 263 the attempt produced a tied sheet bend between item-226-wren-2532 and item-250-wren-2847.\\\",\\\"At tick 264 the join held 5 N for 30 seconds with zero recorded tail displacement, retained deformation or broken strands; each cord extended elastically by 0.0007 m.\\\",\\\"Untying completed at tick 267 and returned both original items.\\\",\\\"Direct inspections at ticks 269 and 270 recorded separate straight cords with 0.34 m centrelines, zero join crossings and no partner or join id. Their recorded conditions were 0.9745 and 0.9865.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"One bounded trial does not establish safe working load, repeated-load durability, or reversibility after heavier loading.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Document one conservative load trial and recovery of separate cords, with measured limitations.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned joining personally.\\\",\\\"Made a second cord and completed a sheet bend.\\\",\\\"Tested at 5 N for 30 seconds.\\\",\\\"Untied the join.\\\",\\\"Inspected both recovered cords directly.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Recorded bounded sheet-bend load result.\\\",\\\"Two recovered separate cord items with inspected geometry and condition.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Nothing for this bounded question; wider reliability remains untested.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Retain the measured limitations when considering a practical binding application.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The actual cords held the recorded light pull and could subsequently be separated into straight cords.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"ba8d2168-ceff-486b-bb86-5ef6cc4dee7c","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"propert